    {
      "note": "The stream uses uniform token ids (uniform ids across 1e6..2e6, the no-skew control) with EOS cut and missing-predecessor windows mixed in; policy comparisons hold this stream identical across arms."
    },
    {
      "note": "hot-resident-prefetch versus hot-resident-no-prefetch isolates what staying resident buys from what prefetch overlap buys; demand-only is the floor of both."
    }
